@startuml
title Weather Station System States

[*] --> Running : Shutdown

state "Running" as Running
state "Configuration" as Configuration
state "Collect Data" as CollectData
state "Prepare Summary" as PrepareSummary
state "Check Status" as CheckStatus
state "Controlled Mode" as ControlledMode
state "Shutdown" as Shutdown

Running --> Configuration : Changes or Power-saving Settings
Running --> CollectData : Triggered by Clock
Running --> PrepareSummary : Request
Running --> CheckStatus : Request
Running --> ControlledMode : Remote Control
Running --> Shutdown : Shutdown Command

Configuration --> Running : Completed
ControlledMode --> Running : Activity Completed
Shutdown --> Shutdown : Successful

title Alert Notifier Component States

[*] --> InitializeComponent : Load Component

state "Initialize\nComponent" as InitializeComponent
state "Waiting for Update" as WaitingForUpdate
state "Processing Update" as ProcessingUpdate
state "Unloading" as Unloading

InitializeComponent --> WaitingForUpdate : Successful Initialization
WaitingForUpdate --> ProcessingUpdate : Detected Update
ProcessingUpdate --> WaitingForUpdate : Update Processed
Unloading --> [*] : Failure or Shutdown

title Equihealth States

[*] --> J1 : [check user]
state J1 <<choice>>
state J2 <<choice>>
state PatientDashboard : Patient
state HealthWorkerDashboard : Health Worker
state GovernmentOfficialDashboard : Government Official
state Logout : Logged Out

J1 --> J2 : Registered User
J1 --> [*] : Not Registered User

J2 --> PatientDashboard : Patient
J2 --> HealthWorkerDashboard : Health Worker
J2 --> GovernmentOfficialDashboard : Government Official

PatientDashboard --> Logout : Completed Tasks
HealthWorkerDashboard --> Logout : Completed Tasks
GovernmentOfficialDashboard --> Logout : Completed Tasks

title National Health Id States

[*] --> Choice1
state Choice1 <<choice>>
state Choice2 <<choice>>
state Choice3 <<choice>>
Choice1 --> Verification : Indian
Choice1 --> [*] : not Indian

Verification : entry / Citizenship status
Verification : do / Verify details
Verification : exit / Verified status

@enduml
